[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3471241568","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112233#issuecomment-3471241568","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112233","id":3471241568,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7O5vFg","user":{"login":"ettiSurreal","id":98223724,"node_id":"U_kgDOBdrGbA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98223724?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ettiSurreal","html_url":"https://github.com/ettiSurreal","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ettiSurreal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ettiSurreal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ettiSurreal/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ettiSurreal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ettiSurreal/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ettiSurreal/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ettiSurreal/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ettiSurreal/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ettiSurreal/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-31T03:58:06Z","updated_at":"2025-10-31T04:16:17Z","body":"I think the spacing of the expand icon could be slightly improved, but that's probably a separate issue.\r\n<img width=\"152\" height=\"53\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/286d3f90-889f-48b5-8845-66660a9b684d\" />\r\n\r\nThe spinboxes here should also visually stand out.\r\n<img width=\"120\" height=\"55\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e8d49ef7-fe7d-432a-bc66-bf8529102acb\" />\r\n\r\n\r\nAlso is it possible to give the subsections some slight rounding? It's really ugly and inconsistent with... literally everything else in the theme having it.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3471241568/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3471371332","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112233#issuecomment-3471371332","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112233","id":3471371332,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7O6OxE","user":{"login":"passivestar","id":60579014,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwNTc5MDE0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60579014?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar","html_url":"https://github.com/passivestar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-31T05:14:54Z","updated_at":"2025-10-31T05:14:54Z","body":"I agree with the linked complaint too, it was a technical compromise rather than a design choice. The coupling that you found is the reason why this problem needs a slightly more involved solution to make it possible to style them separately imo.\r\n\r\nIn addition to them being coupled and not supporting rounded corners there's also an issue of inspector sections having hardcoded alpha multiplier for nested sections. Because of that you can't use subtle background colors for top-level sections as the generated sub-sections become hardly noticeable way too quickly (in both themes), here's an example from this PR:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"408\" height=\"269\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b141ba9c-49d5-4e5d-86e3-ae71e1dc7796\" /><br>\r\n\r\nThose limitations made it hard to fit those elements into the gdscript theme in any tasteful way which is why I had to compromise and omit them entirely. But now that the theme has been nativized it would make sense to solve that.\r\n\r\nAll of those things needs to be drawing themable styleboxes to support rounded corners. Inspector sections will probably also need to be reimplemented using `FoldableContainer`s eventually, but styleboxes are a good intermediate solution that will be much easier to implement for now.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3471371332/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3472570139","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112233#issuecomment-3472570139","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112233","id":3472570139,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7O-zcb","user":{"login":"DeeJayLSP","id":60024671,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDI0Njcx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60024671?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP","html_url":"https://github.com/DeeJayLSP","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-31T11:11:28Z","updated_at":"2025-10-31T12:09:55Z","body":"I added a new property on both themes specifically for the Input Map settings. There shouldn't be side effects anymore, but custom themes that set `prop_subsection` won't affect it anymore unless updated to handle `prop_subsection_action_map`. \r\n\r\nOne problem at a time. The problem was the lack of contrast and highlights in Input Map, only that is solved here.\r\n\r\n(I would probably make another PR to use a fully transparent subsection color specific to the Inspector in the future, that's the only place where setting `prop_subsection` alone worsened IMO)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3472570139/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3473360056","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112233#issuecomment-3473360056","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112233","id":3473360056,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7PB0S4","user":{"login":"YeldhamDev","id":30739239,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNzM5MjM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30739239?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev","html_url":"https://github.com/YeldhamDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-31T14:33:03Z","updated_at":"2025-10-31T14:33:03Z","body":"@DeeJayLSP I think @passivestar meant is that the ideal solution would be making those sections use `StyleBox`es, so margins and rounded corners could be applied.\r\n\r\nHowever, this component is not `EditorInspector`, but `Tree`. So such modification would be need to be applied to it in a way that somehow doesn't break compatibility with the background color settings that it currently uses.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3473360056/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3474249001","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112233#issuecomment-3474249001","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112233","id":3474249001,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7PFNUp","user":{"login":"DeeJayLSP","id":60024671,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDI0Njcx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60024671?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP","html_url":"https://github.com/DeeJayLSP","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-31T18:08:15Z","updated_at":"2025-10-31T18:24:41Z","body":"I found a way to highlight at least the Action column without touching background colors:\r\n<img width=\"1044\" height=\"550\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/dee782f7-60c8-433a-860d-9662d0dc0807\" />\r\n\r\nIt uses `TreeItem::CELL_MODE_CUSTOM` to draw a `StyleBox` behind it. Unfortunately I don't think this works with Deadzone items as.\r\n\r\nAs a side effect, Action `TreeItems` don't visually respond to hover or select anymore, but I don't think this is a problem as it wasn't possible in the old style anyway. It is possible to re-enable the selected highlight but not the hover.\r\n\r\nThe old style is unaffected as the StyleBox is fully transparent.\r\n\r\nTwo questions:\r\n1. Should it go like this anyway?\r\n2. If so, should the selected highlight be enabled? It is barely visible with this color, though.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3474249001/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3474335344","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112233#issuecomment-347433534