":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-31T20:44:43Z","updated_at":"2025-10-31T20:53:34Z","body":"It should be possible to reuse this StyleBox for other TreeItems that previously relied on `prop_subsection` to get highlighted:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"285\" height=\"377\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6507827d-4318-4b5d-b201-3006d3528eea\" />\r\n<img width=\"292\" height=\"98\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d7f0f3d8-abd6-47d1-bfe4-0d5b448b6800\" />\r\n\r\n___\r\n\r\nFor this PR, though, I will keep the focus on Input Map settings. I'll just use a proper naming convention for it to be used in future changes.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3474834806/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":1,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3476575119","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112233#issuecomment-3476575119","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112233","id":3476575119,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7POFOP","user":{"login":"DeeJayLSP","id":60024671,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDI0Njcx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60024671?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP","html_url"